### One point of the log scan (lead_energy_scan_def.mac): leadScanEvents muons of leadScanE GeV,
### normalised to the band leadScanE / 1.19935 - leadScanE x 1.19935 (1.19935 = 10^(1.5/19), half
### a step of the 20-point grid from 0.1 to 100 GeV)

/control/divide leadScanLow {leadScanE} 1.199353946
/control/multiply leadScanHigh {leadScanE} 1.199353946
/tof/cosmic/energyMin {leadScanLow} GeV
/tof/cosmic/energyMax {leadScanHigh} GeV
/tof/cosmic/monoEnergy {leadScanE} GeV
/OutputFile leadscan_t{leadT}_E{leadScanE}
/run/beamOn {leadScanEvents}
